1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,061
Walk through walls,

2
00:00:01,401 --> 00:00:02,701
and you couldn't even walk.

3
00:00:03,362 --> 00:00:04,803
Every atom in your body is

4
00:00:04,823 --> 00:00:07,764
99.99% empty space.

5
00:00:08,384 --> 00:00:09,105
So is the wall.

6
00:00:09,565 --> 00:00:11,126
The only thing stopping you is

7
00:00:11,186 --> 00:00:13,387
electrons pushing back on electrons.

8
00:00:13,887 --> 00:00:14,528
Turn that off...

9
00:00:15,208 --> 00:00:16,369
and it's not just walls.

10
00:00:16,829 --> 00:00:18,390
The floor stops holding you too.

11
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:20,551
You'd sink straight into the ground.

12
00:00:20,991 --> 00:00:22,612
Your feet can't push off anything,

13
00:00:22,892 --> 00:00:24,213
so you can't take a single

14
00:00:24,273 --> 00:00:24,573
step.

15
00:00:25,093 --> 00:00:26,554
Light would pass right through your

16
00:00:26,694 --> 00:00:26,874
eyes...

17
00:00:27,355 --> 00:00:28,395
so you'd be blind.

18
00:00:28,915 --> 00:00:30,336
Air would slip through your lungs,

19
00:00:30,636 --> 00:00:31,577
so you couldn't breathe.

20
00:00:32,077 --> 00:00:33,378
And you'd keep falling,

21
00:00:33,818 --> 00:00:35,039
all the way to the center

22
00:00:35,059 --> 00:00:35,519
of the Earth.

23
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:36,419
So...

24
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:38,120
would you still want to walk

25
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:38,661
through walls?

